              "type": "text",
              "text": "Olivia is a police officer who earned an annual gross income of $63 620. ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "She claimed a tax deduction for a utility belt ($160), a pair of safety glasses ($390), bulletproof vest ($1240) and handcuffs ($420). Calculate Olivia’s annual taxable income.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
